 সাহায্য প্রার্থনা করো", "fa": "و یاری بجویید"}}, {"text": "بِٱلصَّبْرِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلصَّلَوٰةِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِنَّهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَكَبِيرَةٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْخَٰشِعِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "1:5", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Thee (alone) we worship; Thee (alone) we ask for help.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ancak sana ederiz kulluğu, ibadeti ve ancak senden dileriz yardımı, inayeti. (Ya Rab!).", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ہم تجھی کو پوجیں اور تجھی سے مدد چاہیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Hanya Engkaulah yang kami sembah, dan hanya kepada Engkaulah kami meminta pertolongan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِيَّاكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَعْبُدُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِيَّاكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَسْتَعِينُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/cf64b3aedc5958ffbe06.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "tražimo pomoć", "en": "we seek help", "tr": "yardım istiyoruz", "fr": "nous demandons de l'aide", "id": "kami memohon pertolongan", "ur": "ہم مدد مانگتے ہیں", "bn": "আমরা সাহায্য চাই", "fa": "یاری می‌جوییم"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "ٱسْتَعِينُوا۟", "count": 2, "first": "2:153", "audio": "audio/8a64b007be370254e16e.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss